		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Merci Marc.</p><p>Pour infos, j&#039;ai eu ceci également :<br />WITH T1 AS<br />(<br />SELECT (ARRAY[NULL, true, NULL])[k] as Val1, k<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;FROM&#160; generate_series(1,array_upper(ARRAY[NULL, true, NULL],1)) k<br />)<br />SELECT k FROM T1 where val1 = true</p><p>Je vais tester les deux, et comparer les performances.</p>]]></content>
