		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=13211#p13211"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Il y a la solution du bout de PL (que j&#039;utiliserais, ça a l&#039;avantage d&#039;être lisible).</p><p>En SQL pur:</p><p>select * from (SELECT *,row_number() over () from unnest(&#039;{NULL,true,NULL}&#039;::boolean[])) as tmp where unnest=true limit 1;<br /> unnest | row_number <br />--------+------------<br /> t&#160; &#160; &#160; |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2</p>]]></content>
